<title>CANADA: Canadian oilseeds weekly crushing data - Dec 13.</title>
<headline>Canadian oilseeds weekly crushing data - Dec 13.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Oilseed Processors Association weekly summary of member crushing, in</p>
<p>tonnes -</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING	  CANOLA    SOYBEANS</p>
<p>December 11	  39,991    31,544</p>
<p>change/prev week  -26.1 pct  +4.5 pct December 6	   54,110    30,185</p>
<p>November 27	  54,064    30,994</p>
<p>November 20	  49,008    32,752</p>
<p>August 1 to date1,042,568   466,119</p>
<p>-- Note: COPA consists of Archer Daniels Midland Co, CanAmera Foods, Canbra Foods Ltd and</p>
<p>Northern Lite Canola Inc with crush data also provided by</p>
<p>Cargill Ltd, the Canadian unit of Minnesota-based Cargill</p>
<p>Inc.</p>
<p>(Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548)</p>
